-- ---- s 339 Public companies: company's duty to circulate members' resolutions for AGMs -----------------------

-- src:4332 | (1) A company that is required under section 338 to give notice of a resolution must send a copy of it to each member of the company entitled to receive notice of the annual general meeting—
@ref s 339(1) Public companies: company's duty to circulate members' resolutions for AGMs (src:4332)
GIVEN `the company is required under section 338 to give notice of the resolution` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 339(1) the company must send a copy of the resolution to each member entitled to receive notice of the annual general meeting` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the company is required under section 338 to give notice of the resolution`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A company that is required under section 338 to give notice of a resolution must send a copy of it" -- MARGINAL a
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether section 338 requires notice is not known

-- src:4333 | (a) in the same manner as notice of the meeting, and
@ref s 339(1)(a) Public companies: company's duty to circulate members' resolutions for AGMs: the manner (src:4333)
GIVEN `the copy is sent in the same manner as notice of the meeting` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 339(1)(a) the copy was sent in the manner this paragraph requires` MEANS
    IF `the copy is sent in the same manner as notice of the meeting`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(a) in the same manner as notice of the meeting" -- FORK F5

-- src:4334 | (b) at the same time as, or as soon as reasonably practicable after, it gives notice of the meeting.
@ref s 339(1)(b) Public companies: company's duty to circulate members' resolutions for AGMs: the time (src:4334)
